Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.34,0:00:59.20,Title,0,0,0,0,,《星际迷航4：抢救未来》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.95,0:03:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么看？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you make of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是我们未知的文明 所发射的探测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears to be a probe from an intelligence unknown to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.16,0:03:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续用所有已知语言 传达 宇宙和平和你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transmit "peace" and "hello" in all known languages.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.13,0:03:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我接舰船总部 好了 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me Starfleet Command. Ready, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.93,0:03:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是萨拉托加号星舰 正在第五中立区巡航中\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is U.S.S. Saratoga patrolling sector five, neutral zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.84,0:03:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正跟踪一个不明探测器 其轨道向着泰瑞太阳系\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're tracking a probe headed for the Terran solar system.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.61,0:03:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们尝试与其联络 但在已知频率内没有回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attempts to communicate have been negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.18,0:03:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续跟踪 萨拉多加号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Continue tracking,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.96,0:03:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将分析通讯信息并给你回复\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will advise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.08,0:04:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白 主舰 通话完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, Starfleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.84,0:04:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,六 五 四 三 二 一…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six, five, four, three, two, one…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.33,0:04:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,静止画面！停住！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold the image. Hold!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.17,0:04:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,请看清这个货真价实的恶魔吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold the quintessential devil in these matters:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.79,0:04:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 T.科克 叛徒 恐怖分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}James T. Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.31,0:05:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不仅谋杀了一群克林根人 还偷走了他们的飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}He murdered a Klingon crew and stole their vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.58,0:05:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但真正的阴谋和意图\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here is the real plot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.85,0:05:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,正当联盟在此与我们进行和谈之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}While we negotiated peace,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.88,0:05:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,科克正研制起源飞弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kirk was developing the Genesis torpedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是科克的儿子构想出来的 并由他本人进行试爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was conceived by Kirk's son, and tested by the Admiral himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.66,0:05:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可怕的能量所造就的 说得好听点 正是起源星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}This energy created what is called, euphemistically, the Genesis Planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.17,0:05:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是一个为灭绝克林根人而设的秘密基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}A base from which to launch the annihilation of the Klingon people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.64,0:05:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要求引渡科克！我们要求得公道！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We demand the extradition of Kirk. We demand justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.24,0:05:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林根人所谓的公正与众不同 总统阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Klingon justice is a unique point of view.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.62,0:05:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,起源这个名字名副其实 生命的缔造者 而不是死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genesis was perfectly named. The creation of life, not death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.73,0:05:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林根人首先引发了争斗 企图占有其中的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Klingons shed the first blood, attempting to possess its secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.97,0:05:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们凡根人是联盟里众所周知的智能玩偶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vulcans are the intellectual puppets of this Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.64,0:06:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的战舰摧毁了格雷森号星舰 你的人杀死了科克的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Klingons destroyed U.S.S. Grissom. Your men killed Kirk's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.28,0:06:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你否认这些事实吗？我承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you deny these events? We deny nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.78,0:06:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有权保护自己族人 你有权随意杀人么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must preserve our race. By committing murder?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.15,0:06:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,肃静！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.82,0:06:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许再有扰乱秩序的事情发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be no further outbursts from the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.99,0:06:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统先生 我来替被告说两句\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have come to speak on behalf of the accused.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.33,0:06:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,纯属个人偏袒 科克救了他的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Personal bias. His son was saved by Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.33,0:06:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,大使先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Ambassador,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.66,0:06:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无意冒犯 不过委员会的商讨已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Council's deliberations are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.21,0:06:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,科克就这样逍遥法外？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kirk goes unpunished?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.14,0:06:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,科克船长被控违反了九项星舰条例\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Kirk has been charged with violating Starfleet regulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,星舰条例？太叫人不可容忍了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starfleet regulations? That's outrageous!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.29,0:06:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住这一点：只要科克活着 就永无宁日！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember this well: There shall be no peace as long as Kirk lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.91,0:07:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长日志 星际历 第8390天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain's log, stardate 8390.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.74,0:07:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是流落到凡根星球上的第三个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three months of Vulcan exile.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.75,0:07:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦考维博士以他独有的历史讥诮感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. McCoy decided upon a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.89,0:07:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,给夺取的克林根飞船重新命名\N{\fnArial\fs30}for our captured Klingon vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们和五百年前的叛变者一样 难以做出抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the mutineers of 500 years ago, we, too, have a hard choice to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.76,0:07:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,马考伊博士 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. McCoy? Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.46,0:07:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,科蒂先生 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Scott? Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌乎拉 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uhura? Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.95,0:07:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,查科夫 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chekov? Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.07,0:07:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏鲁 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sulu? Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.80,0:07:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况显示 前企业号的船长和船员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The commander and the crew of the late Starship Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.37,0:07:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一致同意返回地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}have voted to return to Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.48,0:07:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,去面对营救史巴克船长所带来的严重后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}to face the consequences of their actions in the rescue of Capt. Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.02,0:07:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢各位 请回修理站去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you all. Repair stations, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.36,0:08:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科蒂先生 我们什么时候能离开这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Scott, how soon can we be underway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.29,0:08:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一天时间 要修复损坏部分不难\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more day. Damage control is easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.46,0:08:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,要读懂克林根文可不简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reading Klingon is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.87,0:08:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经希望他们至少派艘船来 虽然要接受军事审判有够糟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bad enough to be court-martialed,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.44,0:08:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是要乘这艘破克林根飞船回去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but to have to go home in this Klingon flea trap…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.01,0:08:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以从中学到不少 这艘船里还有隐形装置呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}This flea trap has a cloaking device that cost us a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.77,0:08:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只希望这船上的恶臭能消于无形\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wish we could cloak the stench.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.04,0:08:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑 重新开始测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computer, resume testing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.41,0:08:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁说：逻辑乃是我们文明的基石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who said, "Logic is the cement of our civilization with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.39,0:08:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有它我们才脱离了混沌状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}which we ascend from chaos"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.08,0:08:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,提普拉哈斯 我们凡根哲学的守护神\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'plana-Hath, matron of Vulcan philosophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.41,0:09:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,铝亚硫酸盐结晶的分子式是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the molecular formula of aluminum sulphite crystal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.72,0:09:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,后吃王 车吃王 兵吃车 将死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen takes knight, rook takes queen, pawn takes rook. Checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.12,0:09:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,正确 克伦斯对生物工程所做出的贡献是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correct.What contribution to bioengineering was made on Klendth?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.03,0:09:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙大气元素补偿物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The universal atmospheric compensator.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.02,0:09:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,星舰传感器表明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starship sensors indicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.06,0:09:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,它曾被近距离追击\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is being pursued so closely, it occupies the pursuer's space.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,识别对象及其文化特征 克林根干尸化浮雕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Identify object. Klingon mummification glyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.94,0:09:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,1987年地球上发生了什么历史大事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What historic event took place on Earth in 1987?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.24,0:09:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林金沙第一定律是什么？虚幻的东西不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is Kiri-Kin-Tha's first law? Nothing unreal exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.48,0:09:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,调整此核磁成像中的正弦波 使反中性子得以通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adjust this sine wave so that antineutrons can pass through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.35,0:09:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,钆是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is Gadolinium?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.16,0:09:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.77,0:09:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白这个问题 怎么了 史巴克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not understand the question. What is it, Spock?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.61,0:09:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白 母亲 你是半人类啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not understand, Mother. You're half human.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.68,0:10:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,计算机知道啊 这个问题毫无头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The computer knows that. The question is irrelevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,史巴克 对你心智的重塑 用的是凡根人的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}The retraining of your mind has been in the Vulcan way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.15,0:10:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能不理解何谓感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may not understand feelings…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.18,0:10:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但作为我的儿子 你是有感情的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but as my son,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.88,0:10:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们终将浮现\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.19,0:10:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望如此 既然你认为它们有价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish, since you deem them of value.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.96,0:10:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不能在此干等 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I cannot wait here to find them… Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.97,0:10:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有什么必须去的地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where must you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.67,0:10:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须回地球去 去作证词\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must go to Earth, to offer testimony.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.07,0:10:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样做是为了友谊 我这样做是因为当时我也在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do this for friendship. I do it because I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.95,0:10:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,史巴克 众人的利益高于个人利益吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spock… Does the good of the many outweigh the good of the one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.65,0:10:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我所认知的公理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would accept that as an axiom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为一个错误 你活生生地站在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you stand here alive because of a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.49,0:10:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个由你的那些充满感情且并不完美的\N{\fnArial\fs30}made by your flawed, feeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.93,0:10:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类朋友所犯下的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}human friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.16,0:10:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们牺牲了自己的未来 因为他们相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have sacrificed their futures because they believed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.43,0:10:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人的利益 对他们来说更为重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the good of the one, you, was more important to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类会做出不合逻辑的决定 确实这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans make illogical decisions. They do indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.25,0:11:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it comes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.13,0:11:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么造成的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's causing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.43,0:11:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的召唤是由强大的超幅电波传送的 带有巨大的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}A powerful amplification wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.40,0:11:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能隔分离出这电波？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we isolate the wave?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.66,0:11:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能 他正攻击我们整个系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's impacting on our systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.31,0:11:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄色警告 开启防护罩 减缓接近速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yellow alert. Shields up. Reduce closing speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.65,0:11:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,推进器失控 开启紧急推进器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thrusters have been neutralized. Emergency thrusters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.88,0:11:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,无响应 舰长\N{\fnArial\fs30}No response.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.12,0:11:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急照明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emergency lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.19,0:11:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,损坏报告？所有系统全部失效 我们只剩后备动力可用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damage report? Systems down. Reserve power only.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.80,0:12:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,星舰总部 这里是萨拉多加号 能听见我说话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starfleet Command, this is Saratoga. Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.32,0:12:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.06,0:12:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.33,0:12:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告情况 司令 情况不妙 总统先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Status report, Admiral. Not good, Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.70,0:12:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,探测器正朝我们来 它的电波毁掉了沿路的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}The probe is heading for us, damaging everything in its path.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.97,0:12:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林根人已损失了两艘舰船\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Klingons have lost two vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.91,0:12:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,两艘星际舰和三艘小型太空船 都已失去动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two starships and three smaller vessels have been neutralized.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.15,0:12:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去动力？怎么会这样 还不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neutralized? How? We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.82,0:12:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我接约克郡号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me the Yorktown.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.89,0:13:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急频道0130 红色警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emergency channel 0130. Code red.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们和外星探测器的接触已过了三小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since contact with the alien probe,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.47,0:13:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有恢复动力的措施都失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}all attempts to regain power have failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.50,0:13:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们所使用的能量形态\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's using forms of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.96,0:13:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,连我们最好的科学家也弄不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}we do not understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.17,0:13:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能保护我们吗？我们发射了一切所能发射的装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you protect us? We're launching everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.31,0:13:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的轮机长正试图 安装一个太阳帆加速系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are trying to deploy a makeshift solar sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.51,0:13:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,若能成功的话 希望它能产生 足够的能量使我们生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}to generate enough power to keep us alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.84,0:13:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,各系统报告 通讯系统 通讯系统准备完毕 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Systems report. Communications systems all ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,通讯系统操作人 一如往常地做好了准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Communications officer, as ready as she'll ever be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.08,0:13:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏鲁先生 导航系统正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guidance has a functional interface.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.26,0:14:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,船上电脑将和星际联邦记忆库连线\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the Federation memory bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.15,0:14:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器系统和隐形装置在所有飞行模式下均可正常工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons systems and cloaking device are operational.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.76,0:14:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人惊喜呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.12,0:14:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是在敌船里 我可不想因被击落\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in an enemy vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.14,0:14:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,而踏上自己的葬礼之路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not wish to be shot down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.20,0:14:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,主机舱 报告 斯科特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engine room, report.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.37,0:14:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了 我已将锂定序器改进完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're ready. The dilithium sequencer is now a little less primitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经替换了克林根粮仓\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've replaced the Klingon food packs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.41,0:14:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面的气味令我作呕 原来如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were giving me a sour stomach. Is that what it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.68,0:14:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备起航 不想去地球的请离船吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare for departure. Everybody not going to Earth had better get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.38,0:14:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨维克… 该说再见了 是的 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saavik… this is goodbye. Yes, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.12,0:14:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.59,0:14:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我一直没有机会 告诉你 你儿子的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I have not had the opportunity to tell you about your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.80,0:14:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫死得很英勇 他救了史巴克\N{\fnArial\fs30}David died most bravely. He saved Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.27,0:14:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他救了我们所有人 我想你应该知道这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved us all. I thought you should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.88,0:15:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 史巴克船长 祝你旅途一帆风顺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day, Capt. Spock. May your journey be free of incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.85,0:15:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,也祝你平安 中尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live long and prosper, Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.43,0:15:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求允许上船 船长 请求批准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Permission to come aboard, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.10,0:15:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 史巴克 叫我吉姆 你还记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, Spock. Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.74,0:15:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你执行指挥工作的时候 叫你吉姆是不合适的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would not be proper to refer to you as Jim while you're in command.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.24,0:15:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我要为我的穿着道歉 我的制服不知上哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, I must apologize for my attire. I seem to have misplaced my uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.28,0:15:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,就位吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.16,0:15:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定这样好吗？你什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a good idea? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.33,0:15:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说他 回到他的岗位 像什么也没发生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him, back at his post like nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.63,0:15:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定会受影响 没可能操纵好所有推进器的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not exactly working on all thrusters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.20,0:16:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会好起来的 你确定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll come back to him. Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.28,0:16:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.68,0:16:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏鲁先生 带我们回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Sulu, take us home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.05,0:16:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,推进器正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thrusters functional.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.83,0:16:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,脉冲功率达到百分之二十五\N{\fnArial\fs30}One quarter impulse power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.39,0:16:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空站 这里是星舰指挥中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Space dock, this is Starfleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.86,0:16:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有飞船起飞 所有飞船起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Launch all vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.23,0:17:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空站出入口无法开放 所有应急系统全部失效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Space dock doors are inoperative. All systems are non-functional.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.65,0:17:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,启用后备能源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engage reserve power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.27,0:17:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,星舰 太空站紧急呼叫 我们已失去所有内部动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starfleet, this is space dock. We have lost all internal power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.63,0:18:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,据测算以现在的速度 我们将在1.6小时后到达地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Estimating planet Earth, 1.6 hours at present speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.13,0:18:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持航道 查科夫先生 观测到联盟的护航舰吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Continue on course. Any sign of Federation escort?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.93,0:18:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 长官 完全没有巡航中的联盟飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir, and no Federation vessels on patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.91,0:18:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就怪了 乌乎拉 通讯频道有什么消息？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's odd. Uhura, what's on the com channels?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.94,0:18:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很活跃 全是多相传输 互相重叠 一片混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very active. Multi-phasic transmissions. Almost a gibberish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.12,0:18:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试试能不能整理出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see if I can sort it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.49,0:18:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 忙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.32,0:18:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌乎拉很忙 我只是在监控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uhura is busy. I am monitoring.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.89,0:18:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴你的Katra 能回到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sure is nice to have your Katra back in your head,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.43,0:18:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是我的脑中\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.23,0:18:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我或许能承载你的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may have carried your soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.11,0:18:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但肯定无法取代你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I sure couldn't fill your shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.74,0:18:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的鞋？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.21,0:18:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.81,0:19:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们能讨论点哲学问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps we could cover a little philosophical ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.99,0:19:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命 死亡 生命 大自然事物的本质\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life, death, life. Things of that nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.09,0:19:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在凡根星的时候并没时间 复习哲学这门学科\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've not yet reviewed the philosophical disciplines.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.76,0:19:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 史巴克 是我 玛考伊在和你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You really have gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.71,0:19:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可到过别人都没去过的地方啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}where no man has gone before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.50,0:19:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我那是什么感觉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what it felt like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.93,0:19:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在没有参照物的情况下我们无法讨论\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no frame of reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.57,0:19:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说笑话吧 笑话…就是有幽默感的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're joking. A joke is a humorous story.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.31,0:19:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,要讨论你对死亡的看法我就得去死？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to die to discuss your insights on death?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.38,0:19:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 博士 我收到了大量的求救信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm receiving a number of distress calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.89,0:19:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.89,0:20:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿拉斯加首府朱诺上空 云层覆盖范围上升到95%\N{\fnArial\fs30}Juneau, Alaska. Clouds increasing to 95%.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.42,0:20:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,东京 全部被云笼罩 只能使用后备动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tokyo, total cloud coverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.66,0:20:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,列宁格勒已经全部停电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leningrad has lost all electrical power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.50,0:20:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,云的覆盖范围达到100% 温度迅速下降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cloud coverage 100%. Temperature decreasing rapidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.70,0:20:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球云层总的覆盖范围是多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is Earth's total cloud coverage? 78.6%.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.37,0:20:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,向所有空站通告 星舰紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starfleet emergency. Red alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.07,0:20:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急警报 迅速转用行星储备能源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switch to planetary power reserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使用上所有的行星储备能源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with all planetary reserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.82,0:20:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有太阳我们还是不能生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}we cannot survive without the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.26,0:20:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我清楚得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm well aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.33,0:20:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙瑞克大使 恐怕您和我们一块被困在这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ambassador Sarek, I'm afraid you're trapped here with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.14,0:21:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没法回应这个探测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way we can answer this probe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.24,0:21:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果对问题完全不了解 当然没法作出回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's difficult to answer when one does not understand the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.75,0:21:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你或许该发出一个行星求救信号…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you should transmit a planetary distress signal…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.72,0:21:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,…在我们还有时间的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}…while we still have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.03,0:21:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,司令官？怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.03,0:21:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,多重的求救信号 还有一条来自联盟的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Overlapping distress calls and a message from the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.52,0:21:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,播放出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}On screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.31,0:21:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是星际联邦的总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the President of the United Federation of Planets.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.28,0:21:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要接近地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not approach Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.82,0:21:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个轨道探测器发出的信号 正在摧毁地球的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}The transmissions of an orbiting probe are critically damaging this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.72,0:21:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,它正在电离大气层 所有电源都瘫痪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is ionizing our atmosphere. All power sources have failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.60,0:22:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有环地飞船电力不足 探测装置正在蒸发海洋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth-orbiting starships are powerless. The probe is vaporizing our oceans.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.97,0:22:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我们能找出与它沟通的方式 否则我们就将灭顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot survive unless a way can be found to respond to the probe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.94,0:22:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,进一步的通信已不可能了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Further communications may not be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.65,0:22:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,节省你的能源 保住你们自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save your energy. Save yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不惜一切代价远离地球 永别了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Avoid the planet Earth at all costs. Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.68,0:22:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让我们听听探测器发出的信号么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hear the probe's transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.35,0:22:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官！已接到扬声器上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. On speakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.83,0:23:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,史巴克 你怎么看？极不寻常\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you make of that? Most unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.37,0:23:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是具备高能量高智商的未知能量形式\N{\fnArial\fs30}An unknown form of energy of great power and intelligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.41,0:23:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全察觉不出其传输信号是破坏性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}unaware that its transmissions are disruptive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.98,0:23:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得认为其敌对是不合逻辑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find it illogical that its intentions be hostile.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.68,0:23:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你觉得它是在说 嗨你好啊 地球 吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is its way of saying, "Hi, there!" to Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.02,0:23:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球上还有其他形式的生命 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only human arrogance would assume.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.40,0:23:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有自大的人类才会以为 它是针对人类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the message must be meant for man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.79,0:23:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是 这信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're suggesting the transmission is meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.52,0:23:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是给其他生命体 而不是人类的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a life form other than man?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.40,0:23:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少有这可能性 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a possibility. The President did say it was directed at Earth's oceans.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.92,0:23:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统的确说过 它对准的是地球上的海洋\N{\fnArial\fs30}The president did say it was directed at Earth's oceans.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.91,0:23:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能否根据密度 温度和盐度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you modify the signals accounting for density,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.98,0:24:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,来修改探测信号呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}temperature and salinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.39,0:24:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试下 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can try, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.08,0:24:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.32,0:24:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是在水下听起来的声音？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what it would sound like underwater?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.54,0:24:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.39,0:24:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人着迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.39,0:24:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没猜错的话 这条信息不会有回应的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my suspicion is correct, there can be no response to this message.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.83,0:24:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪？去证实我的理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going? To test my theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.14,0:24:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,布恩斯 你待在这儿 不行 我要盯着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bones, you stay here. No way, I want to keep an eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.13,0:25:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如所料 这些传输信号是鲸的歌声\N{\fnArial\fs30}As suspected, the transmissions are the songs sung by whales.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.40,0:25:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲸？确切地说 是驼背鲸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whales? Specifically, humpback whales.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.54,0:25:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直疯了 谁会从几百光年外\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.94,0:25:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射个探测器来和鲸讲话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would send a probe to talk to a whale?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.24,0:25:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有可能 鲸鱼在地球上的出现远早于人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whales were on Earth far earlier than man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.25,0:25:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,在1000万年前 驼背鲸被人类大量捕杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 million years earlier. Humpbacks were heavily hunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.35,0:25:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,21世纪的时候就灭绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They died out in the 21st century.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.45,0:25:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个外星探测器很可能就是来探测\N{\fnArial\fs30}The alien probe could be here to determine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.41,0:25:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们为什么失去了联系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}why they lost contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.19,0:25:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种驼背鲸的回应可以被模拟吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could the humpback's answer to this call be simulated?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.13,0:25:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,声音可以 语言不能 我们可以用混合的信息回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sounds, but not the language. We would be responding in gibberish.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.30,0:26:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这物种在别处可以找到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can the species be found elsewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.45,0:26:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 驼背鲸只有地球上才有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humpbacks were indigenous.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.91,0:26:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是往日的地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.68,0:26:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们没得选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.31,0:26:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须在它毁掉地球前 毁掉这个探测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must destroy the probe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.15,0:26:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样做是没用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}To attempt to do so would be futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.32,0:26:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们总不能就这么掉头离去 总得有个选择吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just turn away. There must be an alternative.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.39,0:26:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一种可能性 虽然我不能保证一定成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.93,0:26:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以试着去把驼背鲸找回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could attempt to find some whales.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.80,0:26:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才还说哪都没有 只有地球上有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just said there aren't any, except on Earth of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.69,0:26:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正是那样说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is exactly what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.20,0:26:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是这样… 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in that case… Wait just a damn minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.41,0:26:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,史巴克 算一下时间翘曲度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spock, start your computations for time warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.95,0:26:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,布恩斯 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bones, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.00,0:27:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要那些能量来维持医疗设施运转\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need that power to keep medical facilities functioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.93,0:27:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有地下储藏系统关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}All underground storage systems have been shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.49,0:27:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯高蒂 这个海湾有多长？大约60英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long is this bay? About 60 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.10,0:27:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能围住使水不外流吗？应该能吧 你想游泳啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you enclose it to hold water? Are you planning to take a swim?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.20,0:27:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了脱离困境 我们必须得找些驼背的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off the deep end. We've got to find some humpbacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.37,0:27:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,驼背的人？鲸鱼 威尔士先生 鲸鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humpbacked people? Whales.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.68,0:27:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,45-50英尺长 每只大概40吨重\N{\fnArial\fs30}45-50 feet long, about 40 tons each.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.35,0:27:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真想用这只生锈的破桶做时间旅行吗？我们之前做过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to try time travel in this rust bucket?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.12,0:27:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先得绕着太阳旋转\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd have to slingshot around the sun to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.87,0:27:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没获得足够速度 你就先被烤熟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}pick up enough speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.79,0:28:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你宁可什么都不做？我更偏好常识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you prefer to do nothing? I prefer common sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.76,0:28:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算带我们回到过去 找到驼背鲸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go back in time, find some whales,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.07,0:28:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它们及时带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}then bring them forward in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.23,0:28:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望它们能让探测器消失 基本如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hope to hell they tell this probe to clear off?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.14,0:28:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是疯狂！还有更好的主意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's crazy! You have a better idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.84,0:28:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,计算进行中 乌乎拉 替我接通星舰司令官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computation is in progress. Uhura, get me Starfleet Command.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.82,0:28:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接受到一个微弱的信号 好像是科克船长发的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm picking up a faint transmission from Admiral Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.59,0:28:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,播放到屏幕上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.23,0:28:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,星舰司令官 我是詹姆斯 科克船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starfleet Command, this is Admiral James T. Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.97,0:28:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经截获并分析了探测器的呼叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have intercepted and analyzed the call of the probe.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.61,0:28:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用卫星备用电源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to reserve power.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.54,0:28:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为只有灭绝了的驼背鲸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is our opinion that only the extinct humpback whale.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.42,0:29:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能正确地回应探测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}can give a proper response to the probe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.35,0:29:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住 用后备电源 星舰司令官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stabilize.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.19,0:29:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到我说的了吗？我们听见了 请继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emergency reserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.99,0:29:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要尝试时间旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going to attempt time travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.87,0:29:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正计算当下的时空隧道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are computing our trajectory at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.00,0:29:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,接回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him back!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.45,0:29:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备连线电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to engage computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.62,0:29:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的目的时间段是？20世纪晚期\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's our target in time? Late 20th century.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.55,0:29:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,能再精确一些吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you be more specific?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.26,0:29:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,用现有设备没法做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had to programme.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.79,0:29:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不把记忆中的变量进行编排\N{\fnArial\fs30}some of the variables from memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.46,0:29:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么变量？燃料剩余量 舰体容积\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the variables? Availability of fuel. Mass of the vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.57,0:29:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及驼背鲸的可能位置 这个时候 应该在太平洋盆地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probable location of whales. In this case, the Pacific Basin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.07,0:30:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在脑子里运算这一切？是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You programmed that from memory? I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.81,0:30:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使和怪兽保卫我们 哈姆雷特 第一幕 场景四\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Angels and ministers defend us"."Hamlet", act 1, scene IV.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.68,0:30:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,从不怀疑你的记忆力 打开电脑 准备翘曲飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No doubt about your memory. Prepare for warp speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.79,0:30:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,防护罩 查科夫 防护罩启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shields, Mr. Chekov. Shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.06,0:30:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿傻人有傻福\N{\fnArial\fs30}May fortune favor the foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.73,0:30:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始翘曲飞行 苏鲁先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp speed, Mr. Sulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.51,0:30:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,翘曲空间2\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.41,0:30:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,翘曲空间3 运行稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp 3. Steady as she goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.08,0:30:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,翘曲空间4\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.79,0:30:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,翘曲空间5\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.26,0:30:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,翘曲空间6\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.93,0:30:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,翘曲空间7\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.87,0:31:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,翘曲空间8 热防护罩过载\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp 8. Heat shields at maximum.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.97,0:31:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,翘曲空间9！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp 9!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.54,0:31:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,9.2，9.3… 我们必须达到开放速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}9.2, 9.3… We need breakaway speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.52,0:31:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,9.5，9.6，9.7…\N{\fnArial\fs30}9.5, 9.6, 9.7…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.85,0:31:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,9.8…\N{\fnArial\fs30}9.8…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.17,0:31:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就趁现在！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.63,0:32:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当初真不该离开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should never have left him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.43,0:32:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 我们在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.07,0:32:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,史巴克 你所说的那是世界的末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're talking about the end of everybody on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.06,0:33:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏鲁先生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Sulu…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.10,0:33:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏鲁先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Sulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.91,0:33:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 先生 我们情况怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, sir. What is our condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.22,0:33:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,损坏的推进器着火了 请显示图像\N{\fnArial\fs30}The breaking thrusters have fired. Picture, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.59,0:33:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球… 但这是什么时候？史巴克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth… But when? Spock?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.30,0:33:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,从大气污染程度看 应该是20世纪后半叶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judging by atmospheric pollution, the latter half of the 20th century.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.40,0:33:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得不错 史巴克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.72,0:33:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在已经被地球此时的探测器发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may be visible to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.34,0:33:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得对 史巴克 启动隐形装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite right. Engage cloaking device.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.42,0:34:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正穿过天际线进入黑夜 往北美西海岸一带追踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crossing the terminator into night. The west coast of North America.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.86,0:34:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收到了鲸的歌声 用扩音器放出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am receiving whale song. Put them on speakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.57,0:34:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.14,0:34:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,歌声是从旧金山传过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The song is coming directly from San Francisco.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.35,0:34:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,从城市里来的？这不可能啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the city? That doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.86,0:34:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 出了个大问题 你能下来一趟吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a serious problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.93,0:34:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间旅行把这些克林根水晶耗尽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's these Klingon crystals. The time travel drained them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.97,0:34:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些晶体正在升华 分解 给我个准确的数字\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're decrystalizing. Give me a round figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.41,0:34:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能保持大概24小时的隐形状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}24 hours, staying cloaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.98,0:35:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后我们就显形了 然后死在水里\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that we're visible and dead in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.38,0:35:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没能量脱离地球引力的束缚 更不要说回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't the power to break out of Earth's gravity or get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.65,0:35:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能相信事情会是这个结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't stop now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.73,0:35:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有让它们再结晶的方法吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't we recrystalize the dilithium?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.36,0:35:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 船长 就算在23世纪也不可能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't even do that in the 23rd century.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.03,0:35:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 在20世纪或许可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral, there may be a 20th century possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.27,0:35:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果记忆不错的话 此时应该有核反应堆这类装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recall there was a dubious flirtation with nuclear fission reactors.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.04,0:35:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于它们会导致毒副作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}They resulted in toxic side-effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.01,0:35:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,熔断时代到来的时候就被取代了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and were replaced in the fusion era.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.42,0:35:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这个时候 我们应该能找到一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at this time, we may be able to find some.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.99,0:35:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你说它们有毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you said they were toxic.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.56,0:35:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以制造一个能安全收集 那些高能量光子的装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}We collect only high-energy photons.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.13,0:35:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些光子可以重新使锂结构结晶 理论上来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}These photons would recrystalize the dilithium structure… theoretically.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.90,0:36:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上哪能找到这些反应堆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where would we find these reactors?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.58,0:36:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,核动力被广泛用在海军舰艇上\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were used in naval vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.61,0:36:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧金山 我出生在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}San Francisco. I was born there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.65,0:36:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,它看上去并没什么不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't look all that different.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.39,0:36:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们在金门公园降落 遵命 先生 降落中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set us down in Golden Gate Park. Aye, sir. Descending.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.40,0:36:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌乎拉和查科夫安排处理 铀资源的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uhura and Chekov are assigned the uranium problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.83,0:36:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,马考伊博士 斯科特先生和苏鲁先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. McCoy, Mr. Scott and Mr. Sulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.85,0:36:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们转换一个装鲸鱼的容器\N{\fnArial\fs30}will convert us a whale tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.14,0:36:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 很有趣！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, joy!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.47,0:36:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,史巴克上尉和我会试着跟踪鲸鱼的歌声\N{\fnArial\fs30}while Spock and I attempt to trace these whale songs to their source.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.65,0:36:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会为您准备好远距离通话用具 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have bearing and distance, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.95,0:36:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要非常小心 这是一个未知领域\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be very careful, this is terra incognita.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.15,0:36:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的很多习俗都会使我们惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many of their customs will take us by surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.26,0:37:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,很显然 这里没人见过天外来客\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of these people have ever seen an extraterrestrial.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.69,0:37:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一种极为原始而又偏激的文明\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a primitive and paranoid culture.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.20,0:37:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,查科夫 替每个小组 配备好移相器和通讯器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a phaser and a communicator.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.57,0:37:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非有紧急情况 否则不要轻易联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radio silence except in emergencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.83,0:37:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,身着制服者摘下等级勋章\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove your rank insignia.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.21,0:37:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有问题吗？好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any questions? All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.44,0:37:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发吧 各就各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do our job and get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.35,0:37:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的世界 还等待着我们去拯救…如果我们能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our own world is waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.08,0:37:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始着陆程序 遵命 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commence landing procedure. Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.79,0:38:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩又打架了？我以为你们昨晚和好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you two fighting again? I thought you made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.83,0:38:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩为什么老是吵架？我喜欢她吵架时的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you two always fighting? I like the way she fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.40,0:38:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对她说你要是以为我会在个破烤炉上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told her I wasn't spending $60.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.37,0:38:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,花费60块钱 那你一准是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a damn toaster oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.84,0:38:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有什么反应？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did she say to that? Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.54,0:38:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟在搞什么鬼？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.25,0:39:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见了吗？没有 你也没看见 闭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see that? No, and neither did you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.90,0:39:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲸鱼在哪里？283度 离这里15.2公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bearing to the whales? 283 degrees, 15.2 kilometers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.71,0:39:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都记住我们降落的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody remember where we parked.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.00,0:39:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,走路看着点 傻蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch where you're going, dumb-ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.04,0:39:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才是傻蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double dumb-ass on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.29,0:40:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人类能撑过20世纪真是个奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a miracle our race survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.28,0:40:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们仍在用钱 我们得弄点到手\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're still using money.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.73,0:40:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,史巴克 其他人留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spock. The rest of you stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.90,0:40:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们分散点吧 免得看起来跟一群参观的学生似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break up, you look like a cadet review.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.23,0:40:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,18世纪的美国人 很有价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}18th century American. Quite valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.40,0:41:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定要当了它们吗？你给我多少钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do want to part with them? How much will you give me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.91,0:41:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是马考伊博士送的礼物吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those were a gift from Dr. McCoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.59,0:41:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,将来还会是的 美妙之处就在于此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they will be again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.85,0:41:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少钱？如果镜片完好的话值得更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much? The lenses aren't intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.68,0:41:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你100 那算多吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you $100. Is that a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.96,0:41:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么多了 别乱用\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all there is. Don't splurge.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.96,0:41:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？开干吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All set? Good hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.04,0:41:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,史巴克先生 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to your restored memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.38,0:41:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏你恢复的记忆 再加上一点好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a little bit of good luck,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.64,0:41:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在旧金山闲逛就为了找一只驼背鲸\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're walking around San Francisco looking for humpback whales.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.38,0:41:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么解决这个问题？简单的逻辑就能解释了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will you solve this problem? Simple logic will suffice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.55,0:41:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们利用这张地图开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will make use of this map.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.92,0:41:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,从乌乎拉那儿我得到了距离和方位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the distance and bearing from Uhura.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.91,0:41:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能找到与之相符的地点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we juxtapose our coordinates,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.16,0:42:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们应该能找到那里 也就是在283.7度…\N{\fnArial\fs30}we should be able to find our destination 283.7 degrees…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.27,0:42:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们会在索斯里托的鲸鱼馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find what we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.54,0:42:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到我们想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the Cetacean Institute in Sausalito.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.90,0:42:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,两只分别叫乔治和格雷西的驼背鲸\N{\fnArial\fs30}two humpback whales, George and Gracie.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.54,0:42:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的？简单逻辑\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know this? Simple logic.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.39,0:42:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,零钱 是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does "exact change" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.16,0:42:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎样转换出这个容器？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we convert this tank?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.33,0:42:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有透明铝… 那是好多年后才有的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had transparent aluminum… You're years too early for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.67,0:42:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找找20世纪有否替代品 但上哪去找？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's find their equivalent. But where?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.85,0:42:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到了吗？是的 被美国政府拥有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find it? Yes, now we need directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.02,0:43:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在得了解去的方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we need directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.19,0:43:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,借问一下 你能告诉我阿拉米达 的海军基地怎么走吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, can you direct me to the naval base in Alameda?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.83,0:43:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是存放核动力舰艇的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's where they keep the nuclear vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.47,0:43:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,核动力舰艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nuclear vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.61,0:43:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下… 我们在找核动力舰艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse us… We are looking for nuclear vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.18,0:43:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能告诉我 阿拉米达的海军基地在哪吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you tell me where the naval base is in Alameda?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.99,0:43:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我们在找阿拉米达的核动力舰艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, we are looking for the nuclear vessels in Alameda.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.99,0:43:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮助我们吗？阿拉米达海军基地在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you help us? Where is the Alameda naval base?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.56,0:43:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,核动力舰艇在哪？跨过海湾在阿拉米达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the nuclear vessels? Across the bay in Alameda.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.20,0:43:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我说的阿拉米达\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I said, Alameda.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.55,0:44:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.99,0:44:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 你能把那噪音关掉吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, would you mind stopping that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.00,0:44:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 能关了那噪声吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, would you mind stopping that damn noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.15,0:44:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 我能问你个问题吗？别叫我船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral, may I ask you a question? Don't call me Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.76,0:44:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前叫我吉姆 什么问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used to call me Jim. What's your question?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.53,0:44:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到这里后 你说话的方式改变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your use of language has altered since our arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.44,0:44:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,夹杂着很多色彩浓重的隐喻\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is currently laced with more colorful metaphors.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.98,0:45:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个超级大笨蛋 你是指脏话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Double dumb-ass on you." The profanity?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.45,0:45:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他们说话的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the way they talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.82,0:45:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会注意的 除非你用它们宣誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody pays any attention unless you swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.49,0:45:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个时代的文学 比如呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the literature of the period. For example?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.79,0:45:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰奎琳 苏珊的作品 哈罗德·罗宾斯的小说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The works of Jacqueline Susann. The novels of Harold Robbins.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.10,0:45:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Giants".
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.67,0:45:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个表演 鲸鱼的世界 五分钟后开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next showing of "The World of Whales" begins in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.98,0:45:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.56,0:45:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.53,0:45:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,今早我是你们的导游\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your guide this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.30,0:45:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是吉莉安 泰勒博士 大家可以叫我吉莉安\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dr. Gillian Taylor.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.23,0:45:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是海洋鲸鱼研究院的副主管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm assistant director of.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.94,0:45:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,请跟我来 如果听不到我的声音尽管开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Maritime Cetacean Institute.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.04,0:46:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲸鱼研究院世界上唯一只展示 与鲸鱼有关的物品的馆所\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Cetacean Institute is the only museum devoted to whales.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.38,0:46:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如各位所见 我们提供很多东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a great deal to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.45,0:46:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,相对于我们熟知的鲸鱼来说 那些东西就显得很小了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that is small compared to what we don't know about whales.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.75,0:46:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个共同错误就是 误以为鲸鱼是鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}One commonly held misconception is that whales are fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.72,0:46:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们不是 和你我一样 它们是哺乳动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not. They're mammals like you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.82,0:46:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,恒温动物 呼吸空气 哺乳喂养\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warm blooded, breathing air and producing milk to nurse their young.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.50,0:46:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲸鱼会袭击人类吗？像里写的那样 不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do whales attack people? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.13,0:46:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数鲸鱼没有牙齿 它们有柔软 如口香糖般的结构\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most whales don't have teeth, they have a gum-like tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.67,0:46:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以捕食小虾 也限制了它们的攻击性\N{\fnArial\fs30}that strains tiny shrimp for food, and that is the limit of their hostility.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.88,0:46:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是 它们的天敌却极富攻击性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, their principal enemy is far more aggressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.41,0:46:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指人类？说得委婉些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean man? To put it mildly.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.78,0:46:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有史以来 人类捕捉鲸鱼来做成各种制品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men have always harvested whales for a variety of purposes,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.45,0:46:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在大部分的制品都可以合成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}most of which can be synthesized.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.83,0:47:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百年前 人类用手掷鱼叉捕了很多鲸鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}100 years ago, using hand-thrown harpoons, man did plenty of damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.20,0:47:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是相比这个世纪 那都不算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that is nothing compared to what he has achieved in this century.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.90,0:47:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类捕杀鲸鱼已使其濒临绝种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mankind has hunted whales to the brink of extinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.27,0:47:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上最大的动物蓝鲸 事实上已经灭绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Virtually gone is the blue whale, the largest creature on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.31,0:47:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管已尽力禁止捕杀 还是有国家和私商\N{\fnArial\fs30}Despite all attempts to ban whaling, there are still countries and pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.75,0:47:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍然参与到对这些无害生物的杀戮之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}currently engaged in the slaughter of these creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.19,0:47:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,驼背鲸的数量曾以几十万计 现在只有大约一万只存活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humpback whales, once numerous, now number about 10, 000 specimens.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.46,0:47:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,被捕杀的鲸鱼 还都未发育成熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those that are taken are no longer fully grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.80,0:47:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 很多雌鲸在怀孕期间被捕杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}In addition, many of the female whales are killed with their unborn calves.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.04,0:47:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,捕猎一个种群致使其灭绝是不合理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}To hunt a species to extinction is not logical.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.41,0:47:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有谁说过人类存在是合理的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever said the human race was logical?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.91,0:47:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,请跟我来 我将为你们介绍 机构引以为豪的成就\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll follow me, I'll introduce you to the institute's pride and joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.56,0:48:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是世界上最大的天然海水池\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the largest seawater tank in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.13,0:48:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,养着仅有的两头驼背鲸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It contains the only two humpback whales in captivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.31,0:48:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是成年驼背鲸 每只重达45000磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are mature humpbacks weighing 45, 000 pounds each.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.81,0:48:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在幼年时期游至旧金山海湾 然后被送到了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wandered into San Francisco Bay as calves and were brought here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.92,0:48:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们叫它们乔治和格雷西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call them George and Gracie.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.49,0:48:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 雌鲸和雄鲸在同一个池子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's perfect. A male and female in a tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.63,0:48:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以把它们一起传回去 看来我们的运气不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can beam them up together.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.20,0:48:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,很漂亮 不是吗？而且极其聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful, aren't they? And extremely intelligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.61,0:48:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,请跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll follow me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.58,0:49:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然它们教会我们很多东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Despite all they're teaching us,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.04,0:49:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是要把它们放回公海\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have to return them to the open sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.22,0:49:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我们没有足够的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We simply don't have enough money.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.54,0:49:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,来满足它们一天两吨虾的食粮\N{\fnArial\fs30}to feed them two tons of shrimp a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.83,0:49:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,多久以后？很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}How soon? Soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.00,0:49:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很糟糕 因为它们真的很友好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too bad, because they're really quite friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.90,0:49:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经非常非常喜欢它们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've grown quite attached to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.31,0:49:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是观看乔治和格雷西的 一种更好的方式 水下看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now here's a much better way to see George and Gracie. Underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.09,0:49:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听到的被称为鲸鱼之歌 雄鲸发出的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you're hearing is recorded whale song, sung by the male.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.53,0:49:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,它到处唱歌 唱6至30分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll sing anywhere from 6 to 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.33,0:49:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在海里 其它鲸鱼会接着把歌唱下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the ocean, other whales will pick up the song and pass it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.50,0:50:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些歌每年都有变化 我们不知道其意义何在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The songs change every year. We don't know their purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.51,0:50:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是导航的信号吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they a navigational signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.62,0:50:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是交配仪式的一部分吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they part of the mating ritual?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.72,0:50:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,抑或是我们完全无法理解的交流方式？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is it pure communication beyond our comprehension?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.96,0:50:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦率的说 我们并不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankly, we just don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.13,0:50:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许它在对那个人唱歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's singing to that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.54,0:50:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼！容我失陪 请在此稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?! Excuse me, wait right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.31,0:50:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,请让一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.16,0:50:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那干什么？跟她说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you doing in there? Yes, speak up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.89,0:50:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝试去和它们交流 交流 交流什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attempting the hell to communicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.94,0:50:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无权呆在这里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no right to be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.70,0:51:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到这位女士说什么了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard the lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.77,0:51:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们把这些鲸鱼看成自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we assumed that these whales are ours to do with.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.05,0:51:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,认为自己能对它们为所欲为\N{\fnArial\fs30}as we please,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.24,0:51:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将会和那些造成他们 濒临灭绝的人一样有罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}we would be as guilty as those who caused their extinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.18,0:51:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.57,0:51:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你们马上离开 否则我就报警了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but get out now, or I call the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.48,0:51:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那没有必要 我们只是想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not necessary. We're trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.29,0:51:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友在骚扰我的鲸鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend was messing up my whales.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.09,0:51:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们喜欢你 但是它们不是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They like you, but they are not the hell your whales.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.36,0:51:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 是它们告诉你的吧 它们怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose they told you that. The hell they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.03,0:51:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.90,0:51:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,史巴克 关于那些我们讨论过的 色彩浓重的隐喻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spock Yes? About those colorful metaphors that we discussed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.44,0:51:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你没必要再用它们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't quite got the knack of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.60,0:51:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何？首先 你还没完全掌握技巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not? You haven't quite got the knack of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.58,0:51:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有别老是说真话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see. it's not always necessary to tell the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.26,0:51:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能说谎 我不是指撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot tell a lie. I don't mean lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.53,0:52:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你可以夸大其辞 你以前这么干过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you could exaggerate. You've done it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.76,0:52:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得了吗？见鬼 我不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you remember? The hell I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.77,0:52:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从精神交流中还知道了什么？鲸鱼们不喜欢人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else did you learn? Their species is unhappy with man.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.77,0:52:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们愿意帮助我们吗？我把我们的意图说得很清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they going to help us? I communicated our intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.25,0:52:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 我明白 他们并不想伤害你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. I know. They didn't mean any harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.03,0:52:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说这里有些奇事 只是两个傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard there was some excitement. Just a couple of kooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.67,0:52:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好么？我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you doing? I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.51,0:52:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别对我隐瞒了 我太了解你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me fish stories, I've known you too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.91,0:52:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃 别再让我为难了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob, it's tearing me apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.58,0:52:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么觉得 但是我们深陷进退两难的境地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel the same, but we're stuck between a rock and a hard place.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.76,0:53:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论是让它们留在这里 还是放归它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we keep them here or let them go,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.49,0:53:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是会威胁到它们的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're still risking their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.19,0:53:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.83,0:53:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们不是人类 它们的智商是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not human beings. Their intelligence is…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.43,0:53:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 鲍勃 我对的同情心\N{\fnArial\fs30}My compassion is not limited to.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.43,0:53:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不取决于其智商的高低\N{\fnArial\fs30}my estimation of one's intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.96,0:53:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长 这里是第二小队 我已经有了反应堆的坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Team leader, this is team two. I have the co-ordinates of the reactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.46,0:53:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是科克 我们已经找到了核动力舰艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kirk here. We have found the nuclear vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.47,0:53:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得不错 船长 那是企业号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done. Admiral, it is the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.64,0:53:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了 你有什么计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood. What's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.25,0:54:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚进去收集光子 没人会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will beam in tonight and collect the photons. No one will know.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.39,0:54:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白同意 保持联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood and approved.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.39,0:54:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,通话结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kirk out.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.23,0:54:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来了 如果我们能小心出牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she is. If we play our cards right,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.81,0:54:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该能套出那些鲸鱼什么时候离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can find out about the whales.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.77,0:54:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,打牌有什么用？这不是罗宾汉和他的随从吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will playing cards help? It's Robin Hood and Friar Tuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.41,0:54:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要去哪？回旧金山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you fellas heading? Back to San Francisco.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.82,0:54:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们来就是为了游个泳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came all this way just for a swim?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.39,0:54:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我即使解释也无济于事 我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't try to explain. I'll buy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.76,0:54:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他呢？他是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about him? He's harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.13,0:54:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,在六十年代的话 他就是伯克利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in the 60s, he was part of.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.98,0:54:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,言论自由运动的中坚力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}the free-speech movement at Berkeley.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.03,0:54:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他太有善心了（LDS美国慈善协会）\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did a little too much LDS. LDS?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.20,0:54:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你们一程\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you a lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.28,0:54:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是 对不幸的人太过心软\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a notorious weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.92,0:55:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才跟鲸鱼在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}for hard-luck cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.68,0:55:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可不想惹麻烦 但你们已经那么做了 上车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want to be any trouble. You've already been that. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.43,0:55:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.10,0:55:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要犯傻 那里有个拆轮胎棒 我伸手就能拿到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't try anything. I've got a tire iron right where I can get at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.54,0:55:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是伯克利人？我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you were at Berkeley? I was not.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.34,0:55:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他记忆也有问题 你们哪里人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Memory problems, too. Where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.11,0:55:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱荷华州 哦 怪不得不会游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iowa. A landlubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.35,0:55:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩在那里究竟想干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell were you guys really trying to do back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.22,0:55:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是为了男人之间的事？我很讨厌男人之间那点破事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it some kind of macho thing? I really hate that macho stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.06,0:55:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能问你个问题吗？说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you a question? Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.87,0:56:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你放了鲸鱼后会发生什么事情？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going to happen when you release the whales?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.80,0:56:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们就得靠自己了 具体点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll have to take their chances. What does that mean exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.51,0:56:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,像其他驼背鲸一样 他们将面临捕鲸者的危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be at risk from whale hunters just like all other humpbacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.45,0:56:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在研究院里你们说的灭绝 到底是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you mean with all that stuff about extinction?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.99,0:56:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你给我们介绍时的意思 驼背鲸可能会灭绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}He meant what you said on the tour, that humpbacks may well disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.36,0:56:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他用的时态可不是这样的 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what he said, farmboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.96,0:56:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将会和那些造成他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We would be as guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.13,0:56:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,濒临灭绝的人一样有罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}as those who caused,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.48,0:56:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这句话用的过去将来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}" past tense, "their extinction."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.44,0:56:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的记忆奇佳 对你的话我记得一清二楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a photographic memory. I see words.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.04,0:56:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定这时候不该用 那些精彩的隐喻吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure it isn't time for a colorful metaphor?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.18,0:56:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不会是那些教鲸鱼找鱼雷 的傻瓜士兵吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you some dipshit army guy trying to teach whales to retrieve torpedoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.92,0:56:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是 还好 否则我马上就让你们滚下车\N{\fnArial\fs30}No dipshit. Good, I'd have let you off here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.99,0:57:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,格瑞西怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gracie is pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.36,0:57:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你究竟是谁？不要再耍我了 你怎么会知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you? Don't jerk me around. How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.07,0:57:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还不能告诉你 让我说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't tell you that. Let me finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.00,0:57:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是部队里的人 也无意去伤害鲸鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not in the military and we intend no harm to the whales.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.31,0:57:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们或许能帮到你 用你完全无法想象的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may be able to help you in ways you couldn't possibly imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.42,0:57:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信 我敢打赌 很有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or believe, I'll bet. Very likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.59,0:57:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没完全听懂我们的意思 那是肯定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not catching us at our best. That much is certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.26,0:57:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想等晚饭的时候 我们再愉快地商量一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we'd all be a lot happier discussing this over dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.70,0:57:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.84,0:57:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们喜欢意大利菜吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you guys like Italian?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.88,0:57:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.85,0:57:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢意大利菜 你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I love Italian… and so do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.30,0:58:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特博士 我是尼克斯博士 工厂经理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Scott, I'm Dr. Nichols, plant manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.17,0:58:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常抱歉 完全是个误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm terribly sorry. There's been an awful mix-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.41,0:58:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本不知道你要来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was never told about your visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.48,0:58:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着向他们解释来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to clear things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.21,0:58:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科蒂教授 我说你从爱丁堡来 一路奔波\N{\fnArial\fs30}I explained that you'd come from Edinburgh.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.42,0:58:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,为的是研究普勒希公司的制作方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}to study Plexicorp's manufacturing,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.13,0:58:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他们好像对此一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they don't know anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.13,0:58:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一无所知？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know anything about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.16,0:58:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以置信 我可是跑了几百万英里 几千 几千\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've come millions of miles. Thousands!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.70,0:58:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 几千英里 应邀来检查 我强烈要求见你们的老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was invited on an inspection. I demand to see the owners.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.84,0:58:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科蒂教授 放松些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Nichols has offered to.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.85,0:58:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克斯博士会亲自带我们参观车间的\N{\fnArial\fs30}take us around the plant personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.08,0:59:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他答应了？是的 很荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has? With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.42,0:59:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可就不一样了 格里高利\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's different. Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.03,0:59:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的助手可以参加吗 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}May my assistant join us? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.43,0:59:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你的角色可别太投入了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bury yourself in the part.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.27,0:59:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 挺好看的机子 休伊204型的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. A good-looking ship. Huey 204, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.51,0:59:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你也开飞机吗 嗯 到处去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right on, do you fly? Here and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.88,0:59:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上学那会儿驾驶过跟这个差不多的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I flew something similar in my Academy days.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.79,0:59:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这个就不算什么新鲜玩意儿了 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then this must be old stuff to you. Yes…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.62,0:59:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过挺有趣的 问你几个问题行吗 问吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But interesting. Can I ask you a few questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.90,0:59:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这地方不错 尼克斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a fine place you have here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.30,1:00:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 您的工程学知识让人叹服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Your knowledge of engineering is most impressive.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.20,1:00:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们那儿 我们称他为神奇师傅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back home we call him the miracle worker.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.80,1:00:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你们拿点喝的？尼克斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I offer you something?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.32,1:00:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是有东西要给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I offer something to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.60,1:00:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你还在从事聚合体的生产吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes? You're still working with polymers.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.20,1:00:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在？那我还能有别的可以干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else would I be working with?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.54,1:00:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确 有什么别的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else indeed?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.90,1:00:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我换个方式说吧 60x10英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}How thick would a piece of.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.56,1:00:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,载水量18000立方英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}your plexiglas need to be,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.10,1:00:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的树脂玻璃一般厚度是多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}at 60 feet by 10 feet to withstand pressure of 18, 000 cubic feet of water?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.70,1:00:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个简单 六英寸 仓库里就有 我注意到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six inches. We have it in stock. I've noticed.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.50,1:00:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,假设 只是假设 我有一个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, suppose…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.10,1:00:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以让你制造出同样功能的玻璃\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I were to show you a way to manufacture a wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.20,1:00:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过只有一英寸厚\N{\fnArial\fs30}that would do the same job, but be only one inch thick.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.20,1:00:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说是不是有些价值 你开玩笑的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that be worth something? You're joking.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.30,1:01:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许教授可以使用你的计算机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps the professor could use your computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.30,1:01:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,请吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computer…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.40,1:01:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,计算机… 计算机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computer!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.00,1:01:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 计算机 用键盘就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, computer. Just use the keyboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.90,1:01:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,键盘 多离奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}A keyboard, how quaint!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.50,1:01:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,透明铝材 这就是通行证 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transparent aluminum? That's the ticket, laddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.80,1:02:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,要花上好些年才能弄清这个模型的变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would take years to figure out the dynamics of this matrix.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.30,1:02:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 不过你会富有得难以想像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but you would be rich beyond the dreams of avarice.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.20,1:02:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是有些价值 要不我按删除？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, is it worth something to you, or should I punch up "clear"?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.20,1:02:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.70,1:02:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没空 玛德琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now, Madeline.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.90,1:02:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底要干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly did you have in mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.60,1:02:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}A moment alone, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.70,1:02:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该意识到如果我们把方程式给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you realize that if we give him the formula,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.80,1:02:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就会改变未来吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're altering the future?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.70,1:02:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦？说不定就是他发明的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? How do we know he didn't invent the thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.60,1:02:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.90,1:03:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定你不会改变主意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't you change your mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.04,1:03:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在的脑袋有什么问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with the one I have?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.80,1:03:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,开玩笑的 再见 老朋友 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little joke. Goodbye, old friend. Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.40,1:03:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道格雷西怀孕了 没人知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody knows that Gracie is pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.00,1:03:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷西自己知道啊 我就在这儿等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gracie does. I'll be right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.20,1:03:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们吃饭的时候他就在树丛里瞎逛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he just going to hang around the bushes while we eat?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.50,1:03:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有他自己的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his way.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.00,1:03:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你信任我吗 绝对信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you trust me? Implicitly.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.70,1:04:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,大蘑菇和意大利辣香肠 多加些洋葱 再来一份羊腿片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Large mushroom and pepperoni, with extra onions and a Michelob.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.80,1:04:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,选得好 你呢 先生 一样双份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great choice. And you, sir? Make that two.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.70,1:04:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么可爱的女孩子 怎么会当上鲸鱼学家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does a nice girl like you get to be a cetacean biologist?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.70,1:04:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,走运吧 失去这些鲸鱼你很沮丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just lucky, I guess. You're upset about losing the whales.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.80,1:04:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很有洞察力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very perceptive.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.00,1:04:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样把鲸鱼送走呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will that be done, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.02,1:04:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,用一架特殊的747把它们运到阿拉斯加\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be flown to Alaska.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.50,1:04:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里把它们放归大海 航空运输\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be released there.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.72,1:04:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你就再见不到它们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the last you'll see of them?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.50,1:04:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.16,1:04:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我们在它们身上加识别装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we'll tag them.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.70,1:04:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,再用特殊频率的无线电追踪它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}with special transmitters and monitor them.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.40,1:04:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以把这些鲸鱼带到别处去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could take those whales somewhere…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.20,1:05:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,到它们再也不会被猎杀的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}…where they'd never be hunted.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.60,1:05:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,从索斯里托出发 如果没有汽车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't even get from Sausalito to San Francisco.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.11,1:05:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己连旧金山都到不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}without a lift.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.90,1:05:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你对我的能力评价这么低\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm so inept,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.61,1:05:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还在这儿共进晚餐干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}how come we're having dinner?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.40,1:05:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为不走运的笨蛋 干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a sucker for hard-luck cases. Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.10,1:05:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 你为啥和那个傻家伙一起旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I want to know why you travel around with that ditzy guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.90,1:05:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道格雷西怀孕了 还管你叫船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}who knows that Gracie is pregnant and calls you "Admiral".
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.40,1:05:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能把我的鲸鱼带到哪里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where could you take them… my whales?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.00,1:05:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在哪里才会安全呢 这个不是「何地」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where would they be safe? It's not a matter of where,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.13,1:05:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是「何时」的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}but when.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.30,1:05:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是现在 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would have to be right now. Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.30,1:05:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,圈养的驼背鲸所产的幼鲸都活不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No humpback born in captivity has ever survived.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.50,1:06:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是在海上它们也安全不到哪里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they won't be safe at sea because of.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.28,1:06:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在刚好是捕鲸季节\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the hunting this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.30,1:06:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你都看到了 就像他们说的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you see, that, as they say, is that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.20,1:06:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.20,1:06:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么 你有个寻呼机\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that? You have a pocket pager.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.90,1:06:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是医生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.10,1:06:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么了 我告诉过你不要打过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you not to call me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.57,1:06:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我以为你应该想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I thought you'd like to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.10,1:06:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正要把它们带过来 好的 祝你们走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're beaming them in now. All right. Good luck. Kirk out.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.00,1:06:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,原原本本告诉我吧 干嘛不告诉我鲸鱼什么时候走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to try it from the top? Tell me when the whales are leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.30,1:06:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁 你觉得我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you? Who do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.60,1:07:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会是外太空来的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me! You're from outer space.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.80,1:07:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我来自爱荷华 我只是在外太空工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm from Iowa, I work in outer space.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.90,1:07:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就猜对了哦 我就知道迟早会有外太空来客的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was close. I knew outer space was going to come into this.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.40,1:07:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,要听事实吗 是的 我正听着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth? I am all ears.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.70,1:07:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 告诉你事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay… the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.30,1:07:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是23世纪末的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am from the late 23rd century.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.70,1:07:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来的目的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've come back in time.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.70,1:07:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把两头驼背鲸带回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bring two humpback whales with me, in an attempt to…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.80,1:07:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让这个物种重新繁衍\N{\fnArial\fs30}…repopulate the species.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.10,1:07:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不直说呢 干嘛要在这里施展魅力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you say so? Why all the coy disguises?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.80,1:08:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想听细节吗 我无论如何不想错过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want the details? Oh, I wouldn't miss this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.50,1:08:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些鲸鱼什么时候放归呢 好吧 到底…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When are the whales being released? Okay, what the hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.90,1:08:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友说对了 格雷西是怀孕了 而且就快生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend was right. Gracie is pregnant, very pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.10,1:08:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天中午 在一个中等规模的表演场\N{\fnArial\fs30}At noon tomorrow, in a media circus,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.29,1:08:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些鲸鱼会被船运出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}the whales get shipped out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.70,1:08:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天中午 我们要走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noon tomorrow? Are we leaving?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.70,1:08:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 我们的时间不多了 那个可以打包吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have much time. Could we have that to go?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.70,1:08:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 谁买单呢 在你那个时代不会没有货币吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Who gets the bad news? They don't use money in your time?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.88,1:08:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们确实没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.50,1:09:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,要多久 取决于我们与反应堆之间的屏蔽墙厚度\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long? It depends on the shielding.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.20,1:09:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 这是我吃过的最短一餐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Admiral, that was the briefest dinner I've ever had,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.70,1:09:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是我听到过的最长的鱼故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and certainly the biggest fish story I've ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.10,1:09:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我鲸鱼身上发射器的频率是多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me something. The whale's transmitter, what's the frequency?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.70,1:10:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 那是机密 瞧 我根本不知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, that's classified. Look, I don't have a clue who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.50,1:10:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想带我参观你的飞船吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't want to show me around your spaceship, would you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.80,1:10:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那并非我的第一选择 那好吧 我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wouldn't be my first choice. Well, there we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.30,1:10:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到这儿来 就是要两头驼背鲸回到23世纪去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am here to bring two humpbacks into the 23rd century.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.20,1:10:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是没有别的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can go to the open sea to get them.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.43,1:10:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会到海里去抓 不过我还是想要你的那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather have yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.80,1:10:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我 对你 对它们都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better for me. It's better for you. It's better for them.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.50,1:10:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.80,1:10:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是谁 自己想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you? Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.20,1:10:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可别想太久 我没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take too long. I'm out of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.30,1:10:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是改主意了 就到这儿找我 这儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where I'll be. Here?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.80,1:10:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这公园里？对\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the park. Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.20,1:11:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天早上容器就造好了 那就差不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tank will be finished by morning. That's cutting it close.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.90,1:11:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二组怎么样了 不知道 等他们打电话过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about team two? We're waiting for them to call.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.80,1:11:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 我们算走运的了 两头鲸鱼就在我们手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn! We've been so lucky. Two perfect whales right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.00,1:11:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是不赶快行动 我们会失去它们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we might lose them.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.75,1:11:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们的任务很可能完不成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then our mission would fail.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.10,1:12:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务？你说的是地球末日啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our mission? You're talking about the end of every life on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.00,1:12:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一半人类血统 你对这个没感觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're half human. Haven't you got any feelings about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.50,1:12:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来了 太怪了 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is again. That's too weird. Commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.10,1:12:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是在运行测试程序吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you running the test program?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.60,1:12:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 不过显然能量正在枯竭\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting a power drain.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.70,1:12:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该来自船体内部\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be coming from inside the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.00,1:12:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗杰森指挥官 是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander Rogerson. Yes, Chief,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.70,1:12:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也在追踪那个 是什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're tracking that, too. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.30,1:13:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科蒂 我们准备好传送出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scotty, we're ready for beam-out.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.60,1:13:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科蒂 听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scotty, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.50,1:13:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confirmed. Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.30,1:13:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,司令部指挥官吗？我是罗杰森指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Commander Rogerson.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.00,1:13:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,4号反应堆有入侵者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have an intruder in number four M.M.R.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.60,1:13:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科蒂 听到了吗 几乎听不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scotty, do you read? Lass, I can hardly hear you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.60,1:13:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,传输动力已经跌至最低了 我只能把你们分两次传回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power is down to minimal. I'll bring you in one at a time.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.80,1:13:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿好收集器 你先走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the collector. You go first.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.90,1:13:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.10,1:14:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scotty.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.70,1:14:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.70,1:14:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.30,1:14:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科蒂 还要多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scotty, how soon?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.40,1:14:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,查科夫 快要中断了 请再发信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chekov, you're breaking up. Please signal again.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.10,1:14:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见了吗 斯科蒂 现在时机正好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me? Now would be a good time.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.00,1:14:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.70,1:14:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,查科夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chekov!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.20,1:14:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和他失去联系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.70,1:14:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,行星联盟的星际舰队查科夫指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander Pavel Chekov. Starfleet. United Federation of Planets.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.20,1:14:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 指挥官 你有什么要说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, Commander, is there anything you want to tell us?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.30,1:15:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么 你是谁 在这做什么 还有这些是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what? Who you are and what these are?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.50,1:15:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫查科夫 星际舰队的一名指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Pavel Chekov, a commander in Starfleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.60,1:15:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,编号 656-5827 D\N{\fnArial\fs30}Service number: 656-5827 D.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.40,1:15:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,从头说起 什么从头说起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take it from the top. The top of what?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.20,1:15:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,姓名 我的姓名吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name? My name?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.20,1:15:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是敢跟我玩花招 你就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play games with me, and you're through.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.50,1:15:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完了？那我可以走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am? May I go now?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.50,1:15:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢 他是个俄国佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think? He's a Russkie.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.70,1:15:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当然是个俄国佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course he's a Russkie,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.63,1:15:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过还是个痴呆 我们最好通知华盛顿方面\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he's a retard or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.20,1:15:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 好了 给我射线枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move. Okay, give us the ray gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.70,1:15:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命令你们 趴在地板上 否则我就开枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't lie on the floor, I will have to stun you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.70,1:15:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 开枪吧 很抱歉 不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, stun me. I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.90,1:16:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是因为辐射\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be the radiation.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.40,1:16:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gangway!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.90,1:16:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,上甲板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit the deck!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.90,1:17:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人摔下去了 派个医护兵过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man down. Get a corpsman over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.80,1:17:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有消息吗 没有 我不该把他留在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any luck? Nothing. I shouldn't have left him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.90,1:17:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了你该做的 加油吧 会找到他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did what was necessary. Keep trying, you'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.80,1:17:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科蒂 你答应要对水晶做个评估的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scotty, you promised an estimate on the crystals.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.30,1:17:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,进展颇为缓慢 长官 明天能好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be well into tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.85,1:17:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不够好 你应该做得更好才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to do better.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.40,1:17:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会努力的 他可是有点焦躁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try, sir. He's in a wee bit of a snit.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.90,1:17:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个感情深沉的人 还有别的新说法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a man of deep feelings. What's new?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.00,1:18:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们昨晚走了 我们不想让大众和媒体发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}They left last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.30,1:18:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我觉得这样你更好受些\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought it would be easier on you this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.30,1:18:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不让我说再见 就把它们送走了？你个混账！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent them away without even letting me say goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.50,1:19:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 科克舰长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral! Admiral Kirk!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.00,1:19:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,科克舰长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Kirk!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.80,1:19:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,科克舰长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Kirk!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.50,1:20:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,科克舰长 听见我说话了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Kirk, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.50,1:20:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们走了 我需要你帮忙 你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gone. I need your help. Are you in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.90,1:20:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 出了点事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral, we have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.70,1:20:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,科克舰长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Kirk!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.50,1:20:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,科克舰长 听见我说话了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Kirk! Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.20,1:20:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.60,1:20:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 爱丽丝 欢迎漫游奇境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Alice. Welcome to wonderland.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.20,1:21:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的 是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true! Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.00,1:21:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你能来 不过不是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you're here, but you picked a hell of a time to drop in.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.20,1:21:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的吗 是的 看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this real? Yes, take a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.50,1:21:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,装你的鲸鱼的容器 可它们走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storage tanks for your whales. They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.90,1:21:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,走了？昨晚就被带走了 也没告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone? They were taken last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.20,1:21:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在应该在阿拉斯加了 见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in Alaska by now. Damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.00,1:21:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你可是去找它们的吧 我哪儿也去不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can go find them, right? I can't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.50,1:21:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算什么飞船啊 少了一个人的飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of a spaceship is this? It's a spaceship with a missing man.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.50,1:21:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 重获全部动力 谢谢 史巴克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full power has been restored. Thank you, Mr. Spock.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.20,1:21:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 博士 欢迎登机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, welcome aboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.10,1:21:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 您在吗 乌乎拉 出什么事啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral, are you there? Uhura, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.60,1:22:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到查科夫了 他们要带他去动个紧急手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've located Chekov. They're taking him to emergency surgery.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.70,1:22:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪儿 慈善医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where? Mercy Hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.20,1:22:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在使馆区 他情况危殆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Mission District. His condition is critical.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.30,1:22:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该活不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not expected to survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.40,1:22:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我去 别让他落在20世纪的医生手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go in there. Don't leave him in the hands of 20th-century medicine.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.50,1:22:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得麦考伊博士是对的 我们应该帮助查科夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest that Dr. McCoy is correct. We must help Chekov.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.90,1:22:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样做合逻辑吗 不合逻辑 但符合人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the logical thing to do? No, but it is the human thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.60,1:22:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你能帮我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Will you help us?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.00,1:22:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么帮 我们看上去要像医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}How? We'll have to look like physicians.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.00,1:22:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们试试这里 你检查那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll try down here. You check there.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.60,1:23:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况？肾透析\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter? Kidney dialysis.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.20,1:23:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,透析 这是什么 黑暗时代吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dialysis? What is this, the Dark Ages?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.30,1:23:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,给 吞下去 要是还有问题 找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, swallow that. If you have any problems, call me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.90,1:23:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.60,1:23:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.10,1:23:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他关在警戒区 再上一楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's being held in the security corridor one flight up.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.07,1:23:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况危殆\N{\fnArial\fs30}His condition is critical.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.80,1:23:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰了 我们来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, we'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.60,1:23:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,顶住门 紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold the door. Emergency.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.60,1:23:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在那儿 全都听见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there. I heard the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.60,1:23:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩特拉伯说要彻底化疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weintraub said radical chemotherapy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.00,1:24:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那哥特里伯呢 他说用图像疗法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Gottlieb?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.65,1:24:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为他们就要打起来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He talked about image therapy.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.60,1:24:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以置信 你有不同意见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unbelievable! You have a different view?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.10,1:24:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去像西班牙的宗教审判所 糟糕的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds like the Spanish inquisition. Bad day.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.00,1:24:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让让 对不起 我们有命在身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the way. We have orders…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.60,1:24:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 你想让她死在你手上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it! This is an acute case.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.62,1:24:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这女士是典型的上腹腔水肿\N{\fnArial\fs30}of upper-abdominal distension.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.50,1:24:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.50,1:24:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说她得了什么病 肚子痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say she's got? Cramps.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.00,1:24:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是谁 不戴口罩 这些人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You aren't masked! Who are these people?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.40,1:24:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不认识 你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.10,1:24:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,切开脑动脉 你读的什么学位 牙科吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tearing of the meningeal artery. What's your degree in, dentistry?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.40,1:24:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么解释脉搏低 呼吸缓慢和昏迷呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you explain slow pulse, low respiratory rate and coma?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.90,1:24:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个眼底检查 对于这个个案 眼底检查毫无用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}A funduscopic examination… …is unrevealing.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.70,1:25:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,去除血肿就会降低脑压\N{\fnArial\fs30}An evacuation of the haematoma will relieve the pressure.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.80,1:25:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 在他脑袋上钻个洞是不行的 应该修补动脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drilling holes in his head is not the answer. The artery must be repaired.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.50,1:25:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的屠刀拿开 让我来救他 要不就太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put away your butcher knives and let me save this patient.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.40,1:25:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让他们开除你 如此外行的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have you removed. Such unprofessional behavior…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.30,1:25:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,进那个小房间吧 那是什么 一把枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into that little room. What is that? A gun?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.25,1:25:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this? I've no idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.70,1:25:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把锁给熔化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He melted the lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.10,1:25:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们简直是在跟中世纪的人打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dealing with medievalism here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.40,1:25:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,化疗 还有眼底检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chemotherapy! Funduscopic examinations!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.90,1:25:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,查科夫 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chekov, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.40,1:25:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,查科夫 听见我说话了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pavel, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.70,1:26:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要醒过来了 查科夫 跟我说话呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming around. Pavel, talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.30,1:26:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,姓名 职务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name? Rank?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.00,1:26:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,姓名：查科夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chekov, Pavel.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.10,1:26:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,职务：指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rank: Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.70,1:26:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,病人怎么样了 他会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the patient? He's going to make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.20,1:26:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是和一女病人一起进去的呀 小小的失误\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came in with a she. One little mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.00,1:26:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.90,1:26:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们带走了病人 找人帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've taken the patient.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.50,1:26:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.90,1:27:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不行 查科夫 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now, Pavel. Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.50,1:27:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个医生给了我一粒药片 我就长出了一个新的肾脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctor gave me a pill and I grew a new kidney.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.40,1:27:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且功能完好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fully functional!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.10,1:27:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.80,1:27:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在鲸鱼会在哪儿呢 给我海图 我会指给你看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where would the whales be by now? Do you have a chart?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.90,1:27:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我只需要无线电频率去追踪它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me the radio frequency.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.22,1:27:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢 我要跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.30,1:27:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行的 我们的下一站是23世纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our next stop is the 23rd century.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.51,1:28:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎 我反正也是孤身一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I've got nobody here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.80,1:28:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要帮那些鲸鱼 我没时间跟你争论了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to help those whales. I've got no time to argue.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.80,1:28:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我无线电频率 401兆赫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The radio frequency, please. 401 megahertz.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.10,1:28:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢…你所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you… for everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.00,1:28:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科蒂 把我运回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scotty, beam me up.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.00,1:28:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.00,1:28:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,史巴克 动力到底在哪儿 再等一分钟 舰长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spock, where the hell's the power? One damn minute, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.00,1:28:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在回忆这个的工作原理 我得习惯用休伊（飞机）\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to remember how this worked. I got used to a Huey.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.20,1:28:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你耍我 你需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tricked me. You need me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.70,1:28:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐吧 苏鲁先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a seat. Now, Mr. Sulu.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.70,1:28:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.00,1:29:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐形装置稳定 系统正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cloaking device is stable. All systems normal.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.90,1:29:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续助推攀爬 机翼 5x0 舵 稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maintaining impulse climb. Wing: Five by zero. Helm: Steady.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.10,1:29:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,建议 推进到10000 转舵 310\N{\fnArial\fs30}Advise reaching 10, 000. Steer 310.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.40,1:29:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌乎拉 搜寻鲸鱼 401兆赫 正在搜寻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uhura, scan for the whales. 401 megahertz.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.10,1:29:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,推进到10000了 舰长\N{\fnArial\fs30}10, 000, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.30,1:29:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,机翼 巡航模式 全速前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full impulse power.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.20,1:29:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,转舵310 到白令海峡 预计时间 12分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}310 to the Bering Sea. ETA: 12 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.60,1:29:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲸鱼容器安全吗 当然 但我从没运输过400吨东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are the whale tanks secure? Aye, but we're beaming up 400 tons.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.30,1:29:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,400吨？不止是鲸鱼 还有水\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just the whales, it's the water.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.60,1:29:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.50,1:29:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有信号吗 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any contact? Negative.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.90,1:30:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像有问题 你的感觉完全正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}You appear to have a problem. Your perception is correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.50,1:30:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,要回到23世纪我们出发时的准确时段\N{\fnArial\fs30}In order to return us to the exact moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.78,1:30:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以回溯的时间之旅作为参照物\N{\fnArial\fs30}we left the 23rd century.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.40,1:30:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,计算了加速度曲线的相关用时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I calculated the time elapsed in relation to the acceleration curve.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.90,1:30:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个应该的 问题何在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naturally. So what's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.80,1:30:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,加速度不再是恒定值 那就尽力吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Acceleration is no longer a constant. Then take your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.80,1:30:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么尽力 猜啊 史巴克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best shot? Guess, Spock.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.30,1:30:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽力地猜想 猜可不符合我的个性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your best guess. Guessing is not in my nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.50,1:30:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人是完美的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, nobody's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.00,1:31:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是它了 联系上鲸鱼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it! Affirmative. Contact with the whales.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.40,1:31:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,方位：327 范围：600 海里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bearing: 327. Range: 600 nautical.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.50,1:31:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,放到屏幕上 你是怎么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it on the screen. How can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.90,1:31:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在鲸鱼中测到了一个信号 方位 328度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a signal closing in on the whales, bearing 328 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.10,1:31:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.80,1:31:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么船 捕鲸船 我们来晚了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of ship is that? A whaling ship. Are we too late?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.30,1:31:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,全速降落 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full-power descent. Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.40,1:33:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,十秒钟 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten seconds, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.20,1:34:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 看你的了 斯科蒂 十秒钟 舰长\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Scotty. Ten seconds, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.90,1:34:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,五 四 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five, four, three…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.10,1:34:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}…two, one.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.40,1:34:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 鲸鱼在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral, there be whales here!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.40,1:35:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 我们的翘曲速度呢 全速 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done. Do we have warp speed? Full power now, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.40,1:35:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你… 苏鲁先生 是 长官 翘曲飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you will, Mr. Sulu. Aye, sir. Warp speed.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.90,1:35:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏鲁先生 我要带客人去看看她的鲸鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Sulu, I'm going to take our guest to look at her whales.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.60,1:35:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些数量不定的鲸鱼群\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does the variable mass of whales.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.18,1:35:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么才能切合我们的重新繁衍计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}fit into our re-entry program?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.70,1:35:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科蒂先生没有给我准确的数目啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Scott cannot give me exact figures…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.40,1:35:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来猜 猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will make a guess. A guess?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.40,1:35:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你啊 史巴克 那可真不寻常\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, Spock? That's extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.80,1:35:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他不明白 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he understands. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.00,1:35:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的意思是你的猜测 比多数人的事实更可靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}He feels safer about your guesses than most people's facts.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.50,1:35:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说他在恭维我 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying it is a compliment? It is.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.40,1:36:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我一定要做出最好的猜测\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I will make the best guess I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.60,1:36:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,「他们说海是冷冰冰的 其实海里流淌着最热的血」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"They say the sea is cold, but the sea contains the hottest blood of all."
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.50,1:36:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,「鲸鱼不哭」 D.H.劳伦斯写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Whales Weep Not", D.H. Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.00,1:36:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真够有讽刺意味的 人类杀死这些生物的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ironic. When man was killing these creatures,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.40,1:36:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是在毁灭自己的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was destroying his own future.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.00,1:36:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些动物似乎见到你很高兴 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The beasties seem happy to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.12,1:36:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你喜欢我们的鱼缸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you like our aquarium.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.00,1:36:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个奇迹 斯科蒂教授 奇迹 奇迹还未降临呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}A miracle, Mr. Scott. A miracle? That's yet to come.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.90,1:36:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.00,1:37:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是也许我们成功不了 你应该呆在你所属的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might not make it. You should have stayed where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.40,1:37:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我属于这里啊 我是个鲸鱼学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I belong here. I am a whale biologist.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.70,1:37:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,假设真有奇迹 你能把它们运过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suppose by some miracle you do get them through?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.10,1:37:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,23世纪除了我还有谁了解驼背鲸呢 说到点子上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who in the 23rd century knows anything about humpback whales?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.90,1:37:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 你最好上来看看 我们的动力正在下降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral, you'd better get up there. We're having a power fall off.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.70,1:37:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,陪着它们 我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with them. I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.20,1:37:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,顶住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.00,1:37:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,翘曲 7.5\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp 7.5.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.80,1:37:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,7.9 防护已是最大值了\N{\fnArial\fs30}7.9. Shields at maximum.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.60,1:37:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能做的就这么多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I can give you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.20,1:37:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能采用急剧坠速吗 无法确保\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we make breakaway speed? I cannot guarantee it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.30,1:37:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我改变轨道来抵消\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall compensate by altering our trajectory.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.30,1:38:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,翘曲8… 8.1 最大速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp 8… 8.1. Maximum speed.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.30,1:38:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要推进器控制 推进器由史巴克控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need thruster control. Thrusters at Spock's command.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.50,1:38:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住 稳住 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady… Steady! Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.60,1:38:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,加速器停止了 是的 舰长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did breaking thrusters fire? They did, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.70,1:38:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们到底在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then where the hell are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.30,1:38:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,探测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The probe.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.70,1:39:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,状况报告 史巴克 没有数据 舰长 计算机不能用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Condition report. Computers are non-functional.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.00,1:39:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,主动力停了 备用动力没有回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mains are down. Aux. Power is not responding.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.00,1:39:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,转为手动操纵 控制不了 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switch to manual control. I have no control, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.70,1:39:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪儿呢 完全失控 象蝙蝠一样两眼瞎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we? Out of control and blind as a bat.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.80,1:39:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,再接通他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him back.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.90,1:39:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 他们朝着大桥前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look! They're heading for the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.30,1:39:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以的话 请把鼻子抬高些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep the nose up if you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.70,1:40:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在水里了 打开舱口\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in the water. Blow the hatch.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.10,1:40:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在要做的就是让鲸鱼出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now all we have to do is get the whales out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.90,1:40:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科蒂 听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scotty, do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.60,1:40:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,走啊 走啊 注意所有人的安全 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! See to the safety of all hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.80,1:41:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住我的胳膊 抓住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lassie, get my arm. I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.60,1:41:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 帮个忙 我在这儿 斯科蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral, help! I'm here, Scotty.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.30,1:41:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的 鲸鱼被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to be all right. The whales are trapped.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.10,1:41:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,分隔舱门没有电了 炸药呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no power to the bay door. Explosive override?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.90,1:41:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在水下没办法拿到啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's underwater. We can't reach it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.10,1:41:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上去 关上舱门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go on ahead. Close the hatch.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.50,1:41:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会被困住的 去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be trapped. Go on!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.50,1:43:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见它们了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see them?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.00,1:43:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.50,1:43:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们干嘛不回应 不唱歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't they answer? Why don't they sing?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.70,1:47:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统先生 我们又有动力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. President, we have power.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.60,1:48:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,委员会议现在开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Council is now in session.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.10,1:48:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you will all take your seats.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.90,1:48:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把被告带进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring in the accused.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.20,1:48:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,史巴克队长 你不必站着接受指控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capt. Spock, you do not stand accused.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.70,1:48:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统先生 我要和队友们站在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. President, I stand with my shipmates.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.60,1:48:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.20,1:48:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,罪名是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The charges are…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.10,1:48:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,共谋 袭击联盟官员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conspiracy. Assault on Federation officers.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.00,1:49:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷盗联盟财产 企业号飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theft of Federation property, namely the Starship Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.20,1:49:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏联盟飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sabotage of the U.S.S. Excelsior.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.60,1:49:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁坏联盟财产 尤其是企业号飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destruction of Federation property, specifically the U.S.S. Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.80,1:49:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有违抗星际舰队长官的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}And finally, disobeying direct orders of the Starfleet Commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.30,1:49:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,科克船长 你有什么辩解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Kirk, how do you plead?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.50,1:49:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我代表全体船员认罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}On behalf of all of us, I'm authorized to plead guilty.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.80,1:49:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,请输入\N{\fnArial\fs30}So entered.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.60,1:49:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于有从轻发落的表现 所有指控只有一项成立\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of mitigating circumstances, all charges but one are dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.30,1:49:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的唯一指控：违抗上级长官的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}The charge of disobeying orders of a superior officer.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.80,1:49:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,只针对科克船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}is directed solely at Admiral Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.10,1:49:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信船长意识到纪律的必要性了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure the Admiral will recognize the necessity for discipline?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.20,1:50:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 先生 詹姆斯.T.科克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do, sir. James T. Kirk…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.50,1:50:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,审判结果是 你由船长降级为队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the judgment of this council that you be reduced in rank to captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.90,1:50:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于该项判决 你将承担\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a consequence of your new rank,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.50,1:50:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经通过实践证实了 你有能力担当的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will be given the duties for which you have demonstrated great ability.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.70,1:50:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥一艘飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}The command of a starship.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.50,1:50:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,请安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silence.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.10,1:50:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的船员将这个星球 从短见中拯救了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your crew have saved this planet from its own short-sightedness.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.20,1:50:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们永远欠你们的情\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are forever in your debt.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.20,1:51:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你感到高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.00,1:51:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.60,1:51:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你去哪儿 你有你的船 我有我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute, where are you going? You have your ship, I have mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.30,1:51:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,科学号 我得学上300年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Science vessel. I've got 300 years of learning to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.30,1:51:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在说再见吗 为什么非得再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, this is goodbye? Why does it have to be goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.00,1:51:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你们那个世纪的人说的 我没有你的电话号码啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like they say in your century, I don't even have your phone number.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.10,1:51:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么找你呢 别担心 我会回来找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will I find you? Don't worry… I'll find you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.50,1:51:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,银河系见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you around the galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.30,1:52:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.50,1:52:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时内我就要回凡根星球了 我想向你道别一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am returning to Vulcan within the hour. I'd like to take my leave of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.40,1:52:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为我这么费劲真是太好了 不费劲啊 你是我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was kind of you to make this effort. It was no effort. You are my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.10,1:52:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你在这次危机中的表现印象深刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I am most impressed with your performance in this crisis.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.20,1:52:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.10,1:52:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得我反对你在星际舰队服役\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I recall, I opposed your enlistment in Starfleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.80,1:52:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我的判断也有可能是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is possible that judgment was incorrect.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.10,1:52:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的同事都是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your associates are people of good character.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.30,1:52:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.80,1:52:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.10,1:53:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要给你妈妈带个口信吗 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any message for your mother? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.50,1:53:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉她…我感觉不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her… I feel fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.00,1:53:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,长寿昌盛 爸爸 长寿昌盛 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live long and prosper, Father. Live long and prosper, my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.90,1:53:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个宇宙中唯一永恒的是官僚政治\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bureaucratic mentality is the only constant in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.20,1:53:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会有艘货船 我还是希望是「求精号」\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get a freighter. I'm counting on "Excelsior".
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.30,1:54:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么还想要那几桶破螺钉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why in God's name would you want that bucket of bolts?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.90,1:54:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,船就是船 无论你说什么 先生 我们坚决执行\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ship is a ship. Whatever you say, sir. Thy will be done.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.50,1:54:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友们 我们回家啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends… we've come home.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.80,1:54:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,舵已就位 船长 好的 我们看看她能干些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helm ready, Captain. All right, let's see what she's got.
